--- Forward: plain WHERE primes an entry that the TopK read reuses
04539_fwd_prime	0	0
04539_fwd_topk	1	1
--- TopK still returns the planted row
10000
--- Forward, multi-conjunct: the TopK read reuses an entry primed by a two-conjunct WHERE
04539_fwd_multi_prime	0	0
04539_fwd_multi_topk	1	1
--- Multi-conjunct TopK still returns the planted row
10000
--- Reverse: a TopK-salted entry must not be read by a plain WHERE
04539_rev_plain	0	0
--- Plain WHERE still returns the planted row
10000
